<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8">
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
		<title>Réinitialisation du mot de passe — CHM Saleux</title>
		<style>
			body,
			table,
			td,
			a {
				-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
				-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
			}
			table,
			td {
				mso-table-lspace: 0;
				mso-table-rspace: 0;
			}
			img {
				border: 0;
				height: auto;
				line-height: 100%;
				outline: none;
				text-decoration: none;
				display: block;
			}
			body {
				margin: 0 !important;
				padding: 0 !important;
				background-color: #f0f2f5;
				font-family: 'Inter', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
			}
			@media screen and(max-width: 600px) {
				.container {
					width: 100% !important;
				}
				.mobile-pad {
					padding: 30px 20px !important;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body style="background-color: #f0f2f5; margin: 0; padding: 0;">

		<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
			<tr>
				<td
					align="center" style="padding: 40px 16px;">

					{# ── CARTE PRINCIPALE ── #}
					<table
						class="container" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="560" style="background:#ffffff; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);">

						{# ── HEADER ── #}
						<tr>
							<td align="center" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1117 0%, #1a1d27 100%); padding: 40px 40px 32px;">
								<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/enzodheilly/chm-saleux-app/main/public/images/favicon/icon2.png" alt="CHM Saleux" width="52" height="52" style="display: block; margin: 0 auto 16px auto; border-radius: 12px;">
								<div style="color: #F57706; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center;">
									Club d'Haltérophilie & Musculation
								</div>
								<div style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.3; text-align: center;">
									CHM SALEUX
								</div>
							</td>
						</tr>

						{# ── CONTENU ── #}
						<tr>
							<td class="mobile-pad" style="padding: 48px 48px 40px;">

								<p style="margin: 0 0 8px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 600;">
									Sécurité
								</p>
								<h1 style="margin: 0 0 20px; color: #111827; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.3;">
									Réinitialisation du mot de passe
								</h1>

								<p style="margin: 0 0 16px; color: #4b5563; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7;">
									Bonjour
									<strong>{{ user.firstName }}</strong>,
								</p>
								<p style="margin: 0 0 32px; color: #4b5563; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7;">
									Vous avez demandé à réinitialiser votre mot de passe. Pour choisir un nouveau mot de passe, cliquez sur le bouton ci-dessous :
								</p>

								{# ── BOUTON D'ACTION ── #}
								<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
									<tr>
										<td align="center">
											<a href="{{ resetUrl }}" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #F57706; color: #ffffff; padding: 16px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">
												Réinitialiser mon mot de passe
											</a>
										</td>
									</tr>
								</table>

								<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; text-align: center;">
									Ce lien est valable
									<strong>1 heure</strong>.<br>
									Si vous n'avez pas demandé cette réinitialisation, vous pouvez ignorer cet e-mail en toute sécurité.
								</p>

								{# ── SIGNATURE ── #}
								<p style="margin: 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
									À bientôt,<br>
									L'équipe
									<strong style="color: #374151;">CHM Saleux</strong>
								</p>

							</td>
						</tr>

						{# ── SÉPARATEUR ── #}
						<tr>
							<td style="padding: 0 48px;">
								<div style="height: 1px; background: #f0f2f5;"></div>
							</td>
						</tr>

						{# ── FOOTER ── #}
						<tr>
							<td class="mobile-pad" style="padding: 28px 48px; background: #fafafa;">
								<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
									<tr>
										<td align="center" style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: center;">
											<strong style="color: #374151; font-size: 13px;">CHM SALEUX</strong><br>
											8 rue Max Dormoy – 80480 Saleux<br>
											Tél : 03.22.89.72.57 ·
											<a href="mailto:chm.saleux@orange.fr" style="color: #9ca3af; text-decoration: none;">chm.saleux@orange.fr</a><br>
											<span style="font-style: italic;">Agréé Jeunesse et Sports – Association loi 1901</span>
										</td>
									</tr>
									<tr>
										<td align="center" style="padding-top: 16px; color: #d1d5db; font-size: 11px; text-align: center;">
											©
											{{ "now"|date("Y") }}
											CHM Saleux
										</td>
									</tr>
								</table>
							</td>
						</tr>

					</table>

					{# ── LIEN SITE ── #}
					<table class="container" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="560">
						<tr>
							<td align="center" style="padding: 24px 0 8px;">
								<a href="https://chm-saleux.fr" style="color: #9ca3af; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px;">
									chm-saleux.fr
								</a>
							</td>
						</tr>
					</table>

				</td>
			</tr>
		</table>

	</body>
</html>
